 "transcript": [
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and I am your father. I am the owner of all the land you have, and I am the father of all of you, and what is all this?\"",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) Eldest son responds to his father",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and it is a man's life we lead and we have our wives and we have our children and we have our affairs, and we do not trouble our father with our details.\"",
  "[action] second son sets up a new business",
  "[says] Wang Lung responds sharply to his sons.",
  "[action] Eldest son follows father into house",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and am I never to be left in peace with my own two sons?\"",
  "[action] The second son follows his father into the house.",
  "Wang Lung (to the second son): \"You also, my second son, are making a fortune, are you?\"",
  "[silence] the second son says nothing.",
  "Wang Lung: \"What am I to do with these two young men of mine, who are my sons?\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son and the second son sit in silence.",
  "[action] The second son laughs and shrugs his shoulders.",
  "[action] The eldest son also laughs and shrugs his shoulders.",
  "[action] The second son shrugs his shoulders.",
